    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Independence of the Basepoint",
        "zh-CN": "基本群与基点选取无关"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Type.annotation(@X,Type),Type.annotation(@x,X),Type.annotation(@y,X)),theorem(FundamentalGroup.fundamentalGroupMulEquivOfPathConnected(x, y)))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "If $X$ is path-connected, then $\\pi_1(X,x_0)$ is independent of the chosen basepoint up to isomorphism, since any two points are joined by a path (Hatcher p. 28).",
          "zh-CN": "若 $X$ 道路连通，则任意两点都可由道路相连，故 $\\pi_1(X,x_0)$ 在同构意义下与基点的选取无关（Hatcher 第 28 页）。"
        }
      }
